    <Title>Towards how to hang a painting upside down on purpose</Title>
    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2021_0156","fieldKey":"date"} -->
    <Date>2021-01-17</Date>
    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2021_0156","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Xochitl Lindqvist talks about the long argument with the colour blue. Background noise: a gallery fan, rain, and someone hammering a nail into a work in progress.</Description>
